 "title": "The session-log flush is skipped on the error path",
 "description": "The session-log flush is skipped on the error path. HostRun::run calls run(self.prepared)? (line 344), so when every backend fails and run returns Err, the flush warning is never produced. The adapter is then dropped, and LoggerInner::drop discards flush and shutdown errors (crates/sc-jev-host/src/obs.rs:45-52). A flush failure on the path where failed send rows matter most is therefore silent. ask_from has the same shape: ask(...)? at compose.rs:419 returns before finish_log at line 420.",
